---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /commercial-real-estate/lease-guide/index.html
title: Commercial Leasing Guide | Rofo
description: Practical commercial leasing guidance for business owners. Understand location strategy, costs, lease types, brokers, negotiations, and mistakes to avoid.
eleventyComputed:
  canonical: "{{ metadata.siteUrl }}/commercial-real-estate/lease-guide/"
---

{% set siteUrl = metadata.siteUrl or "https://www.rofo.com" %}
{% set guideUrl = siteUrl + "/commercial-real-estate/lease-guide/" %}
{% set crumbs = [
  { "label": "Commercial Leasing Guide", "url": "/commercial-real-estate/lease-guide/" }
] %}

<main class="handbook-page">
  <div class="handbook-shell">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

    <script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Commercial Leasing Guide",
  "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
  "url": {{ guideUrl | dump | safe }},
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": {{ guideUrl | dump | safe }}
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Rofo",
    "url": {{ siteUrl | dump | safe }}
  },
  "about": [
    "Commercial leasing",
    "Commercial real estate",
    "Tenant decision making"
  ]
}
    </script>

    <header class="handbook-hero">
      <div class="handbook-eyebrow">Commercial Leasing Guide</div>
      <h1>Understand commercial leasing before choosing a space.</h1>
      <p>
        Commercial real estate decisions are easier when the process is clear.
        This handbook explains location strategy, lease structures, costs, broker roles,
        touring, negotiations, and common mistakes in plain language.
      </p>
      <div class="handbook-actions">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="#handbook-topics">Start reading</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/best-fit-locations/?source=product_education&sourcePath={{ page.url | urlencode }}&journey=new">See My Best-Fit Locations</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="handbook-overview" aria-labelledby="handbook-overview-heading">
      <div>
        <div class="handbook-eyebrow">How to use this handbook</div>
        <h2 id="handbook-overview-heading">Start with the decision, then use the topic that reduces uncertainty.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="handbook-overview__grid">
        <article>
          <span>1</span>
          <h3>Where should the search begin?</h3>
          <p>Use location strategy before comparing buildings.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>2</span>
          <h3>What should the business expect?</h3>
          <p>Understand space, timing, costs, lease types, and improvements.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>3</span>
          <h3>How does the deal get done?</h3>
          <p>Use brokers, LOIs, negotiation, legal review, and validation at the right time.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% set perspective = "Commercial leasing is not just a property search. It is a business decision about geography, cost, operations, flexibility, and risk." %}
    {% include "partials/handbook/rofo-perspective.njk" %}

    <section id="handbook-topics" class="handbook-index" aria-labelledby="handbook-index-heading">
      <div class="handbook-section-header">
        <div class="handbook-eyebrow">Handbook Topics</div>
        <h2 id="handbook-index-heading">Commercial leasing, explained in the order businesses need it.</h2>
        <p>Each topic is designed to stand alone and to support future city pages, district pages, recommendations, space-type pages, glossary definitions, and broker workflows.</p>
      </div>

      {% for category in commercialLeasingHandbook.categories %}
        {% set categoryTopics = [] %}
        {% for topic in commercialLeasingHandbook.articles %}
          {% if topic.category == category.id %}
            {% set categoryTopics = (categoryTopics.push(topic), categoryTopics) %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% if categoryTopics.length %}
          <section class="handbook-category" aria-labelledby="category-{{ category.id }}">
            <div class="handbook-category__intro">
              <h3 id="category-{{ category.id }}">{{ category.label }}</h3>
              <p>{{ category.description }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="handbook-topic-grid">
              {% for topic in categoryTopics %}
                {% include "partials/handbook/topic-card.njk" %}
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </section>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </section>

    <section class="handbook-glossary" aria-labelledby="handbook-glossary-heading">
      <div class="handbook-section-header">
        <div class="handbook-eyebrow">Glossary</div>
        <h2 id="handbook-glossary-heading">Terms worth knowing before reviewing a lease.</h2>
      </div>
      <dl>
        {% for item in commercialLeasingHandbook.glossary %}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ item.term }}</dt>
            <dd>{{ item.definition }}</dd>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="handbook-next-step">
      <div>
        <div class="handbook-eyebrow">Put the knowledge to work</div>
        <h2>Find Locations that Fit Your Business</h2>
        <p>Rofo compares markets against your business requirements and shows which areas are worth exploring first.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/best-fit-locations/?source=product_education&sourcePath={{ page.url | urlencode }}&journey=new">See My Best-Fit Locations</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
